
 When opening a position, place a bracket around it.

 Take Profit is the sale point where you lock in your profit.

 Stop Loss is the sale point where you cut your losses.

 You can do this using OTOCO in Power Etrade.

     1. You set a Sale Triggered by successful buy
     2. You are issuing 2 sales and saying pick one and cancel the other
     3. If price drops to SL, it wlll sell and cancel the TP
     4. If price rises to TP, it will sell and cancel the SL

